    `} />

    <h3 class="lesson-heading">Email pipeline detail</h3>
    <LessonDiagram definition={`
flowchart LR
  A([start]):::e --> B[check_email_processed]:::s
  B -->|dup| Z([skip]):::w
  B -->|new| C[decomposeEmailIntent\nHaiku]:::s
  C --> D[resolveOrderIds\nregex → API → confirm]:::s
  D --> E[Email Specialist\nload + diff + interrupt]:::s
  E --> F{approved?}:::dec
  F -->|yes| G[execute\ntool call]:::s
  G --> H{next op?}:::dec
  H -->|yes| E
  H -->|no| I[send_email\nconfirmation]:::s --> J([done]):::d
  F -->|rejected| K[stop chain\npartial note]:::w

  classDef e   fill:#1e3a8a,color:#fff,stroke:#1e3a8a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef s   fill:#dbeafe,color:#1e3a8a,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
  classDef dec fill:#ede9fe,color:#4c1d95,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px
